  "description": "First-party .NET HTTP client for the FlexForms API (GovUK.Dfe.FlexForms.Api). Includes NSwag-generated typed clients and DTOs for applications, templates, users, roles, tenant admin, files, notifications, and token exchange, plus ASP.NET Core handlers for DfE Sign-In / Entra token exchange, Azure bearer tokens, header forwarding (tenant, template, application), and DI registration. Targets net8.0 and net10.0. Intended for FlexForms Web and other first-party hosts — not a substitute for a narrow integration HttpClient with API-key auth.",
